      "tag": "h3",
      "text": "Coach Jerry Norman"
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "Jerry Norman coached at UCLA from the fall of 1959 to the spring of 1968. He was the driving force behind the UCLA basketball dynasty."
